  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Kafka and notifications",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Phase 6-7. Producers (core) write to topics; consumer groups (notification-service) read at their own pace. **Consumer lag** = messages written but not yet processed: Kafka is holding the backlog so nobody else has to. Lag that grows and then drains is Kafka doing its job; lag that only grows means consumers are too slow."
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Kafka",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumer lag (committed offsets)",
      "description": "Messages not yet processed. Three ways to measure it disagree: committed offsets (the truth), the consumers' records_lag (ignores messages already prefetched into the client: understates), kafka-exporter (right, but its series drop out during rebalances). The priority topic should stay near zero during a blast (6.8).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (group, topic) (notify_consumer_lag)",
          "legendFormat": "{{group}} / {{topic}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (topic) (kafka_consumer_fetch_manager_records_lag)",
          "legendFormat": "consumer records_lag (excludes prefetched) {{topic}}",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (consumergroup, topic) (kafka_consumergroup_lag_sum)",
          "legendFormat": "kafka-exporter {{consumergroup}} / {{topic}}",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "id": 3
    },
